<title>USA: CompScript Inc names CFO.</title>
<headline>CompScript Inc names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompScript Inc said on Thursday it has named John Christe to the newly created position of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, Christe was chief financial officer, treasurer and secretary of Computer Integration Corp.</p>
<p>CompScript provides integrated pharmacy services to the long-term and sub-acute care industries.</p>
